Headings

.define the titles and subtitles of sections of webpages 
.help organize and create a structure that is easy to navigate 
    .search engines use them to understand the page structure, and aid in SEO

Pointers
.use only one <h1> per page 
.maintain a logical structure - h1 > h2 > h3 > h4 
.keep them descriptive - clearly describe the content that follows; easier understanding of what each section is all about 
.avoid overusing heading tags - they are for organizing & not styling content; avoid using them for emphasis 


